OL,3,GNEWSADeath of girl, 11, not
OL,4,Ainvestigated as crime
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe death of an 11-year-old girl whose
OL,7,Fbody was found in a park is not being
OL,8,Ftreated as a criminal investigation,
OL,9,Fpolice have said.
OL,11,FThe girl, who was earlier named by West
OL,12,FMercia Police as Miya, was found near a
OL,13,Fvillage cricket ground in Elmley
OL,14,FCastle, Worcestershire, after being
OL,15,Freported missing late on Sunday
OL,16,Fevening.
OL,18,FCh Insp Daniel Pilkington said the
OL,19,Fforce had "ruled out third-party
OL,20,Finvolvement" in her death and found no
OL,21,Fevidence of suspicious circumstances.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,356,350,200,160,0,100
