OL,3,GNEWSADeath of girl, 11, not
OL,4,Ainvestigated as crime
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We hope this update addresses some of
OL,7,Fthe speculation that has circulated in
OL,8,Frecent days," he said, asking people to
OL,9,F"think of Miya's family before posting
OL,10,Fonline".
